# RNN Movie Review Sentiment Analysis

Simple Streamlit app that loads a trained RNN sentiment model (IMDb) and predicts whether a movie review is Positive or Negative.

## Features
- Web UI via Streamlit
- Uses pre-trained RNN model (`rnn_imdb_model.keras`)
- Tokenizes input using Keras IMDb word index and pads to length 500
- Caches model load for faster startup

## Requirements
- Windows
- Python 3.8+ (recommended)
- Packages: streamlit, tensorflow, keras, (optional) h5py

You can install all dependencies with:
PowerShell:
````powershell
[Activate.ps1](http://_vscodecontentref_/0)
pip install -r [requirements.txt](http://_vscodecontentref_/1)
